#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A brief review of classical machine learning methods relevant to QML, including kernel methods and neural networks."
msgstr "Ulasan singkat metode machine learning klasik yang relevan dengan QML, termasuk metode kernel dan jaringan saraf."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Classical ML review"
msgstr "Ulasan ML Klasik"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
